@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Public scans (website yahi padhegi)
GET {{host}}/api/scans

### 2. Admin login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "9999999999", "password": "Admin@12345" }

### 3. Admin: scan ka price badlo
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/scans/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "MRI Brain", "type": "MRI", "bodyPart": "Brain", "desc": "Brain, Stroke, Headache", "price": 2599 }

### 4. Booking create (login ke bina)
POST {{host}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scanSlug": "mri-brain", "contrast": "yes", "area": "Vaishali Nagar",
  "name": "Neha Jain", "mobile": "9876511122", "age": "28", "gender": "Female",
  "preferredDate": "2026-10-30", "preferredTime": "10:00 AM"
}

### 5. Admin: bookings dekho
GET {{host}}/api/admin/bookings?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Admin: centre add
POST {{host}}/api/admin/centres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo Diagnostic Centre A", "area": "Vaishali Nagar", "address": "Vaishali Nagar, Jaipur", "phone": "9000000001" }

### 7. Admin: booking confirm karo (centre, price, slot)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/bookings/SCN-1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "confirmed", "centreId": 1, "quotedPrice": 2400, "appointmentDate": "2026-10-30", "appointmentTime": "10:00 AM" }

### 8. Bina token admin API (401 aana chahiye)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/scans